From 09946faf7929e074253f2909e55020f025a7bd0f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: anvalproperties-netizen <anvalproperties@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 12:00:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(recovery): responsive repairs across mobile viewports
 (Phases 1-4C)

- Phase 1 & 2: Mobile viewport fixes for Customer and Driver views
- Phase 3: Owner views (Eats & Shop) and Rep view layout enhancements
- Phase 4A: TopBar, navigation, and Admin portals responsive integration
- Phase 4B: AuthModal, BiometricAuthModal, LoyaltyPointsTracker responsive fixes
- Phase 4C: AIInsightsDashboard charts, containers, tooltips, and KPI cards
- Offline queue resilience and Vite port stability
- Preserve all PostGIS boundaries (20km), commission rates (2.5% standard / 3.0% max), and production DB safety
---
